#: ../../source/almdir/outputalm.rst:2
msgid "ALM: Output files"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/outputalm.rst:4
msgid "``PREFIX``.pattern_HARMONIC, ``PREFIX``.pattern_ANHARM?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/outputalm.rst:6
msgid ""
"These files contain displacement patterns in Cartesian coordinate. The "
"length of displacement is normalized to unity for each atom. Created when"
" ``MODE = suggest``. Patterns for anharmonic force constants are printed "
"only when ``NORDER > 1``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/outputalm.rst:11
msgid "``PREFIX``.fcs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/outputalm.rst:13
msgid ""
"Harmonic and anharmonic force constants in Rydberg atomic units. In the "
"first section, only symmetry-reduced force constants are printed. All "
"symmetry-related force constants are shown in the following section with "
"the symmetry prefactor (:math:`\\pm 1`). Created when ``MODE = "
"optimize``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/outputalm.rst:19
msgid "``PREFIX``.xml"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/outputalm.rst:21
msgid ""
"An XML file containing the necessary information for performing phonon "
"calculations. The file can be read by *anphon* using the ``FCSFILE``-tag."
" Created by default when ``MODE = optimize`` (controlled by "
"``FCS_ALAMODE``). When ``LMODEL = enet | adaptive-lasso``, the file is "
"created only when the cross-validation mode is off (``CV = 0``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/outputalm.rst:27
msgid "``PREFIX``.h5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/outputalm.rst:29
msgid ""
"An HDF5 file containing the same information as ``PREFIX``.xml in the "
"HDF5 format. It can also be read by *anphon* using the ``FCSFILE``-tag. "
"Created by default when ``MODE = optimize``. When ``LMODEL = enet | "
"adaptive-lasso``, the file is created only when the cross-validation mode"
" is off (``CV = 0``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/outputalm.rst:34
msgid "``PREFIX``.FORCE_CONSTANT_3RD"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/outputalm.rst:36
msgid ""
"Third-order force constants in the FORCE_CONSTANT_3RD format of the "
"ShengBTE code. Created when ``MODE = optimize`` and ``FC3_SHENGBTE = 1``."
" When ``LMODEL = enet | adaptive-lasso``, the file is created only when "
"the cross-validation mode is off (``CV = 0``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/outputalm.rst:40
msgid "``PREFIX``.FORCE_CONSTANT_4TH"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/outputalm.rst:42
msgid ""
"Fourth-order force constants in the FORCE_CONSTANT_4TH format of the "
"ShengBTE (FourPhonon) code. Created when ``MODE = optimize``, "
"``FC4_SHENGBTE = 1``, and ``NORDER > 2``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/outputalm.rst:45
msgid "``PREFIX``.fc"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/outputalm.rst:47
msgid ""
"Second-order force constants in the Quantum ESPRESSO ``.fc`` format. "
"Created when ``MODE = optimize`` and ``FC2_QEFC = 1``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/outputalm.rst:50
msgid "``PREFIX``.hessian"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/outputalm.rst:52
msgid ""
"The entire Hessian matrix of the supercell. Created when ``MODE = "
"optimize`` and ``HESSIAN = 1``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/outputalm.rst:55
msgid "``PREFIX``.cvset"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/outputalm.rst:57
msgid ""
"This file contains training and validation errors of cross-validation "
"performed with the *manually* given ``DFSET`` (training dataset) and "
"``DFSET_CV`` (validation dataset). Created when the manual cross-"
"validation mode is selected by setting ``CV = -1``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/outputalm.rst:59
msgid "``PREFIX``.cvset[1, ..., ``CV``]"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/outputalm.rst:61
msgid ""
"These files contain training and validation errors of cross-validation "
"performed for ``CV`` subsets. Created when the automatic cross-validation"
" mode is selected by setting ``CV > 1``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/outputalm.rst:63
msgid "``PREFIX``.cvscore"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/outputalm.rst:65
msgid ""
"The mean value and standard deviation of the training and validation "
"errors are reported. Created when the automatic cross-validation (``CV > "
"1``) is finished."
msgstr ""

